Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to the weather report\Nfor the north coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow starts cold and clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,with light wind from the west\Nand about four degrees at sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In the afternoon, clouds come in from the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and rain starts after six o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take an umbrella if you go out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.00,1:00:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the weather. Thank you for watching.\N[Applause]
